OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry into woman's ectopic
OL,4,Apregnancy death set for next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquiry is to be held next year into
OL,7,Fthe death of a young woman who had an
OL,8,Fundiagnosed ectopic pregnancy.
OL,10,FHannah McInally, 24, died in Aberdeen
OL,11,FRoyal Infirmary in November 2021 after
OL,12,Fshe experienced rupturing which led to
OL,13,Fcomplications.
OL,15,FEctopic pregnancies occur when
OL,16,Ffertilised eggs implant outside of the
OL,17,Fwomb, usually in one of the fallopian
OL,18,Ftubes - these can rupture and can be
OL,19,Flife-threatening if not treated.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
